      "paperId": "974c3f8c879a5dec50a5ee9101cb073f042ec56f",
      "title": "IS IT ALREADY POSSIBLE TO LAUGH? (THE CRISIS OF MODERN AESTHETICS AND THE CHANCE OF A NEW ART)",
